  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A conduit may combine skill spheres and talents to perform incredible acts of guile. Conduits are considered Journeyman operatives and choose their Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma modifier as their operative ability modifier.</p>\n<p><em>Special:</em> If you are using <em>Spheres of Might</em>, the conduit can also choose combat talents in place of their skill talents, using their operative ability modifier as their practitioner modifier. A conduit that chooses to do this is treated as having the blended training class feature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conduit#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
